{{- define "bodyClass" -}}page-admin{{- end -}}
{{- define "mainClass" -}}main-admin{{- end -}}
{{- define "chrome" -}}{{ template "adminChrome" . }}{{- end -}}

{{- define "content" -}}
<div class="section-head">
  <h2>Groups</h2>
  <p>
    A group is a team. It can carry a role, so an instance is administered by
    "whoever is on the ops rota" rather than by a list of names that goes out
    of date. A group may be empty on purpose: the teams are usually written
    before the people arrive, and one that could not exist while empty could
    not be prepared in advance.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="filters">
  <input type="search" id="filter" placeholder="Filter by name or member" aria-label="Filter groups">
  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="add">Create group</button>
</div>

<div class="panel table-wrap">
  <table class="grid">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Group</th><th>Members</th><th>Grants</th><th>Source</th><th class="right">Actions</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="rows"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading…</td></tr></tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p class="hint" id="provider-note" hidden>
  Membership of an account that signs in through the identity provider belongs
  to the directory: it is rewritten from the groups claim at every sign-in, so
  those accounts are shown here but cannot be ticked. Change them in the
  directory.
</p>

<div class="modal-back" id="dialog" hidden>
  <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialog-title">
    <h2 id="dialog-title">Create group</h2>
    <p class="sub">One dialog does the whole job: the name, what it is for, the role it grants and who is in it.</p>

    <label for="g-name">Name</label>
    <input id="g-name" type="text" maxlength="{{ .MaxGroupName }}" spellcheck="false">
    <p class="hint">No commas — a comma separates one group from the next everywhere a list of them is written.</p>

    <label for="g-description">Description</label>
    <input id="g-description" type="text" maxlength="{{ .MaxGroupDescription }}">

    <label for="g-role">Role granted</label>
    <select id="g-role">
      <option value="user">None — members keep their own role</option>
      <option value="admin">Administrator — every member administers this instance</option>
    </select>

    <label>Members</label>
    <div class="checklist" id="g-members"></div>

    <p class="banner banner-error" id="g-error" hidden role="alert"></p>

    <div class="modal-actions">
      <button class="btn" id="g-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="g-save" type="button">Save</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden></div>
{{- end -}}

{{- define "scripts" -}}
<script src="/static/js/admin.js?v={{ .Version }}" defer></script>
{{- end -}}
